direction_349 = location "[Weapon Merchant] Gargameth" about "[Weapon Merchant]Gargameth" found "Moradon Castle interior " at 766 589 in zone 21

On available
    Say "Master Blacksmith Hepa is about to talk about the strengthening of weapon! Go there quickly!"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "The strengthening of weapon is a fundamental basis! First as practice, go up the stairs with me, purchase a dagger (+1) from the [Arms Dealer] Gargameth, and then purchase the [Upgrade Scroll (Low Class Item)] from the [Scroll Merchant] Charon and strengthen the dagger (+2)! And then I will exchange it with a weapon that is suitable for your job!"
    Topic "Confirm" do
        Show quest "I say this one more time. The dagger (+1) can be purchased from the [Arms Dealer] Gargameth and the [Upgrade Scroll (Low Class Item)] from the [Scroll Merchant] Charon."

On in_progress
    Say "Haven't you had the strengthening yet? You have to strengthen the dagger (+2) and come back!"
    Topic "Where can I find it?" do
        Map direction_349

On ready
    Say "I succeeded in the refining! Hurry up and bring this to [Blacksmith] Hepa."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "You were successful, weren't you! Let me see. # Please select the weapon that you want to receive as a reward"
